Touch-Based Invocation"],"published":"2022-05-23","authors":["Oggi Rudovic","Akanksha Bindal","Vineet Garg","Pramod Simha","Pranay Dighe","Sachin Kajarekar"],"abstract":"When interacting with smart devices such as mobile phones or wearables, the user typically invokes a virtual assistant (VA) by saying a keyword or by pressing a button on the device. However, in many cases, the VA can accidentally be invoked by the keyword-like speech or accidental button press, which may have implications on user experience and privacy. To this end, we propose an acoustic false-trigger-mitigation (FTM) approach for on-device...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/streaming-on-device","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:c7v5u59tc5pkdgiqbqpvusyl","title":"End-to-End Speech Translation for Code Switched Speech","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/end-to-end","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/end-to-end"],"alternate_titles":["End-to-End Speech Translation for Code Switched Speech"],"published":"2022-05-23","authors":["Orion Weller","Matthias Sperber","Telmo Pires","Hendra Setiawan","Christian Gollan","Dominic Telaar","Matthias Paulik"],"abstract":"Code switching (CS) refers to the phenomenon of interchangeably using words and phrases from different languages. CS can pose significant accuracy challenges to NLP, due to the often monolingual nature of the underlying systems. In this work, we focus on CS in the context of English/Spanish conversations for the task of speech translation (ST), generating and evaluating both transcript and translation. To evaluate model performance on this task,...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/end-to-end","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:o52pz9wx71jinjxilkfyu2sr","title":"Bilingual End-to-End ASR with Byte-Level Subwords","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/bilingual-end-to-end-asr","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/bilingual-end-to-end-asr"],"alternate_titles":["Bilingual End-to-End ASR with Byte-Level Subwords"],"published":"2022-05-23","authors":["Liuhui Deng","Roger Hsiao","and Arnab Ghoshal"],"abstract":"In this paper, we investigate how the output representation of an end-to-end neural network affects multilingual automatic speech recognition (ASR). We study different representations including character-level, byte-level, byte pair encoding (BPE), and byte- level byte pair encoding (BBPE) representations, and analyze their strengths and weaknesses. We focus on developing a single end-to- end model to support utterance-based bilingual ASR, where...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/bilingual-end-to-end-asr","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["speech recognition","neural network","neural"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:pg6v1b5vc5nrwzp9ko70mb5c","title":"Data Incubation - Synthesizing Missing Data for Handwriting Recognition","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/data-incubation","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/data-incubation"],"alternate_titles":["Data Incubation - Synthesizing Missing Data for Handwriting Recog